  "answer": "Based on the data from both sources:\n\n**Most popular Hermes bag for resale (Fashionphile 2023 report):** Hermes Evelyne TPM\n\n**Price comparison for the larger size (Evelyne III 29) from PurseBlog 2024 price increase article:**\n\n- **US 2024 price:** $3,850\n- **Europe 2024 price:** €2,900\n\n**Currency conversion (1 USD = 0.924 EUR → 1 EUR = 1.08225 USD):**\n- €2,900 × 1.08225 = **$3,138.53**\n\n**Result:** It would be **cheaper to buy in Europe** ($3,138.53 equivalent vs $3,850 in the US), saving approximately **$711.47** or about **18.5% less**.",
